              "front": "How do Peterson's Algorithm and Semaphores guarantee Mutual Exclusion?",
              "back": "Peterson's uses shared variables (flag array and turn). Semaphores use atomic wait() (P) and signal() (V) operations modifying an integer counter with hardware test-and-set locks."
